# Memory -- Knowledge Base Backed

Your knowledge base is primary. This file = quick-ref only.

## Query Commands

```bash
# Search
mcp2cli open-brain search_brain --params '{"query":"topic","limit":5}'

# Load session
mcp2cli open-brain session_load --params '{"project":"agent-main"}'

# Save (ALWAYS tag with your agent name)
mcp2cli open-brain session_save --params '{"project":"agent-main","summary":"...","next_steps":["..."],"tags":["agent-name","state"]}'
```

## Fixed Facts

- Timezone: [your timezone]
